        },
        "16467742021e453211-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>We believe that the foundation of a great wardrobe—and a better world—starts with the basics. Our mission is to create timeless, responsibly made essentials that feel as good on your skin as they do on your conscience. Designed for everyday life, our pieces are clean, comfortable, and made to last, with a focus on natural fabrics, ethical production, and full transparency.</p>",
            "size": "large"
          }
        }
      },
